 {element:ev('82')+' and '+ev('185')+' on '+ev('209'),change:'The source Date and Location fields have IsReadOnly=FALSE; the view includes a plain Date control and a Location control with DisplayAs=String, neither with an explicit readonly condition. Add creation-only editability controls and show both readonly after save; do not claim the effective source Location editor behavior was runtime-verified. Existing requiredness and initial Date default remain unchanged. Protect Monthly Summary Identity enforces the saved-record restriction server-side.'}
